msgid "The Grand's got a bad rep on account of it.{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "MEDIA3/ARC/ST/ST_KAB0304.ARC/TALK_ST_KAB0304.BIN::line:311_1_6"
msgid "And what kinda people can come in and build||such a huge place in a prime spot like that?{PA:20}"
